title: Goodlake I Collapses
subtitle: Mission failed.
view-if: chancellor == "Goodlake" and goerdeler_pre_time >= 3 and goerdeler_right_coalition < 50
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/reichstag.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Goodlake I Collapses

With Mallin and [+ royalist_leader +]'s intransigence—and their irreconcilable differences with the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and President DuFour—Goodlake’s position is untenable. In a vote of no confidence, the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] has abandoned him, leaving only the minor parties between the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and the [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>?] backing his government.

- @goerdeler

@goerdeler
title: The Assembly is dissolved.
on-arrival: {!
Q.next_election_month = Q.month + 2;
Q.next_election_time = Q.time + 2;
if (Q.next_election_month > 12) {
    Q.next_election_month -= 12;
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year + 1;
} else {
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year;
}

if (Q.traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate") {
    Q.burgher_dnf -= 2;
    Q.guild_dnf -= 2;
    Q.landed_dnf -= 2;
    Q.burgher_traditionalist += 2;
    Q.guild_traditionalist += 2;
    Q.landed_traditionalist += 2;
} else if (Q.kvp_formed) {
    Q.burgher_traditionalist -= 4;
    Q.guild_traditionalist -= 4;
    Q.landed_traditionalist -= 4;
    Q.burgher_kvp += 4;
    Q.guild_kvp += 4;
    Q.landed_kvp += 4;
    Q.burgher_other += 4;
    Q.guild_other += 4;
    Q.landed_other += 4;
}

Q.pro_republic += 5;
Q.commons_marcher += 4;
Q.commons_collectivist += 6;
Q.disfavored_collectivist += 4;
Q.disfavored_marcher += 2;
!}

Despite this embarrassment and show of unpopularity by the Goodlake government, Staal and the Camarilla see this as an opportunity. He expects that, with the exodus of voters from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> and the certainty of their collapse next election, they will be forced to become more sensible. 

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].